      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'SHOOTING GALLERY



    HOW TO PLAY

    Shoot any target to start the
    clock.

    Knock down every target before time runs out.

    Miss, and the
    back wall hits back.

    Grab ammo and medkits around the stand.



    CONTROLS

    WASD
    - Move

    Shift - Sprint

    Mouse - Look around

    E - Pick up

    Tab
    - Inventory

    Right Mouse - Aim

    Left Mouse - Shoot

    R - Reload

    Esc
    - Pause



    INVENTORY

    Drag items to move or swap them.

    Drop matching
    items together to stack them.

    Hover an item to see its details.

    Right-click
    an item to use, equip or drop it.



    Your progress is saved automatically.'
