  m_text: 'CONTROLS

    WASD - Move

    Shift - Sprint

    Mouse - Look around

    E
    - Pick up

    Tab - Inventory

    Right Mouse - Aim

    Left Mouse - Shoot

    R
    - Reload

    Esc - Pause



    INVENTORY

    Drag items to move or swap them.

    Drop
    matching items together to stack them.

    Hover an item to see its details.

    Right-click
    an item to use, equip or drop it.



    Your progress is saved automatically.'
